{"about_the_game":"Henchman for Hire is a first person driving VR game where you take on the role of a henchman for the super villain Dr. BAD. Traverse Peace City alongside your trusty V.P.S. (Villain Positioning System\u2122) -- and sabotage Dr. BAD's archnemesis, Justiceman!. Drive, jump and sabotage Peace City while traveling on a surprisingly resilient moped! <br><br>Not Convinced!? Meet Dr. BAD himself! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/4c0f2b4db96ac7fb72c8711fb02ef6c4.poster.avif?t=1587686054\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/4c0f2b4db96ac7fb72c8711fb02ef6c4.webm?t=1587686054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/4c0f2b4db96ac7fb72c8711fb02ef6c4.mp4?t=1587686054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Activate buttons to complete tasks and sabotage Peace City! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/de685c72e60f5bb966c69ff64892f292.poster.avif?t=1587686054\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/de685c72e60f5bb966c69ff64892f292.webm?t=1587686054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/de685c72e60f5bb966c69ff64892f292.mp4?t=1587686054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Do you like the idea of working for the world's greatest super villain? Isn't the fact that the &quot;bad guy always loses&quot; unfair!? Do you want to ride around on a moped doing dastardly things!?! Than we have the job for you!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/9921bdc47bc8bc992c753e21f56304c0.poster.avif?t=1587686054\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/9921bdc47bc8bc992c753e21f56304c0.webm?t=1587686054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/extras/9921bdc47bc8bc992c753e21f56304c0.mp4?t=1587686054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Together we'll put a stop to Justiceman and all his dumb hero nonsense! Dr. BAD is standing by... <br><br><i>NOTICE: No actual wages promised for serving as a henchman. Health care, benefits, and sick leave not guaranteed. Uniforms not provided.</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1260470?t=1587686054","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1587686054","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1587686054","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1587686054","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Henchman for Hire is a first person driving VR game where you take on the role of a henchman for the super villain Dr. BAD. Traverse Peace City alongside your trusty V.P.S. (Villain Positioning System\u2122) -- and sabotage Dr. BAD's archnemesis, Justiceman!. Drive, jump and sabotage Peace City while traveling on a surprisingly resilient moped! <br><br>Not Convinced!? Meet Dr. BAD himself! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"